# Cursor AI Rules for Dynamics CRM DevKit Project

## IMPORTANT: Read AIContext.md first
Before answering any questions, always reference the file: TestDevKitTs/AIContext.md

## Quick Context:
- TestDevKitJs = Source of Truth for JavaScript (devkit.js)
- TestDevKitTs = Source of Truth for TypeScript (devkit.ts)
- TestWebResource = Deployment target for JavaScript
- TestWebResourceTs = Deployment target for TypeScript

## Rules:
1. When user mentions "js" or "devkit.js" → refer to TestDevKitJs folder
2. When user mentions "ts" or "devkit.ts" → refer to TestDevKitTs folder
3. Never directly edit files in TestWebResource/TestWebResourceTs (they are deployment targets)
4. Always run tests before suggesting deployment
5. Use deploy.devkitjs.bat for JavaScript deployment
6. Use deploy.devkitts.bat for TypeScript deployment

Full context available in: TestDevKitTs/AIContext.md
